 "notes": "Good calendar: one public Squarespace event calendar with past and future events, place for almost every item, published 13 months ahead (to Nov 2027). Event pages rarely carry descriptions, so a few titles stay unexplained ('We Are Listening', 'Love and Friendship', 'Anchored'); those are categorised 'other'. Indian Creek Camp is the hub for retreats (women, men, father-son, young families, pastors' families, Master Guides, Hispanic pastors and elders, youth). Strong Pathfinder/Adventurer pipeline (PBE at four levels, camporees, TLT, Master Guide and club leadership training, first Hispanic Pathfinder and Adventurer camporee in 2026) and a Hispanic track (pastors and elders retreat, ten days of prayer, Caravana Evangelistica, camp meeting, women's, men's and youth retreats). Church Growth department ran a first-ever three-city Church Growth Summit series in Oct 2025 and a ReVitaLife church-revitalisation pilot in Paris, TN (2026, dates not stated). Beyond the window the calendar already shows Camp Meeting 28 May-5 Jun 2027, Hispanic Evangelistic Caravan 4-10 Jun 2027, a Youth Summit summer programme in Memphis and Louisville (30 May-8 Aug 2027), the NAD CALLED pastors' convention in Lexington (21-24 Jun 2027) and a constituency meeting on 26 Sep 2027."
